[{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l024","ordinal":368641,"en":"That dear lion, proud as a cock,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l025","ordinal":368642,"en":"That steadfast hero, never stirred."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l026","ordinal":368643,"en":"Behold how his fathers and forefathers"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l027","ordinal":368644,"en":"Came to his aid."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l028","ordinal":368645,"en":"The wandering saint Khydyr himself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l029","ordinal":368646,"en":"If you mark it, stood beside him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l030","ordinal":368647,"en":"And nine guardian spirits aided him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l031","ordinal":368648,"en":"When Sarybai spilled blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l032","ordinal":368649,"en":"They came and entered the fray:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l033","ordinal":368650,"en":"A black-mottled leopard"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l034","ordinal":368651,"en":"Sprang at him from the flank,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l035","ordinal":368652,"en":"A bobtailed gray-maned lion"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l036","ordinal":368653,"en":"Prepared to strike him head-on,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l037","ordinal":368654,"en":"And before the people a fierce tiger—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l038","ordinal":368655,"en":"No such being exists among my folk—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l039","ordinal":368656,"en":"Fought at Seytek’s side."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b002:l040","ordinal":368657,"en":"They kept the warrior occupied,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l001","ordinal":368658,"en":"And every mighty blow"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l002","ordinal":368659,"en":"That warrior Sarybai struck,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l003","ordinal":368660,"en":"They intercepted before it reached him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l004","ordinal":368661,"en":"From his right side forty men"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l005","ordinal":368662,"en":"Against that infidel Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l006","ordinal":368663,"en":"Leveled their spears in a row."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l007","ordinal":368664,"en":"Khan Almambet and Chubak were there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l008","ordinal":368665,"en":"Their mighty spirits joining him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l009","ordinal":368666,"en":"Standing as support"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l010","ordinal":368667,"en":"For young warrior Seytek."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l011","ordinal":368668,"en":"“Seize him, my son, seize him,” they cried,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l012","ordinal":368669,"en":"“Finish him—do not leave him alive!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l013","ordinal":368670,"en":"Crush the belly of that villain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l014","ordinal":368671,"en":"Who boasts himself a warrior, like the belly of an ass!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l015","ordinal":368672,"en":"Gouge out both his eyes!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l016","ordinal":368673,"en":"Bring that bellowing wretch down"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l017","ordinal":368674,"en":"And dash him to the ground!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l018","ordinal":368675,"en":"Smash his ribs and back"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l019","ordinal":368676,"en":"Until they crack and splinter!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l020","ordinal":368677,"en":"Pour out his blood in torrents!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l021","ordinal":368678,"en":"Take that shameless swine"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l022","ordinal":368679,"en":"And stretch him full-length!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l023","ordinal":368680,"en":"Strip away the villain’s pride,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l024","ordinal":368681,"en":"End that monster’s life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l025","ordinal":368682,"en":"Gouge out both his eyes!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l026","ordinal":368683,"en":"If you are truly our beloved,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l027","ordinal":368684,"en":"Catch him and slaughter him!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l028","ordinal":368685,"en":"Strip away every last twitch,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l029","ordinal":368686,"en":"Bring the khan to his death,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l030","ordinal":368687,"en":"Bring the lord’s devices to nothing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l031","ordinal":368688,"en":"Beat out his raging madness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l032","ordinal":368689,"en":"And settle his account in full!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l033","ordinal":368690,"en":"Drive him steadily—do not rush!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l034","ordinal":368691,"en":"Pin him fast and let him not stir!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l035","ordinal":368692,"en":"He steeped his steel in blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l036","ordinal":368693,"en":"Seeking a way to strike fiercely;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l037","ordinal":368694,"en":"The cunning swine had gone berserk."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l038","ordinal":368695,"en":"Almambet, Chubak, and the forty men"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l039","ordinal":368696,"en":"Raised their voices in a shout—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0951:b003:l040","ordinal":368697,"en":"Men who had departed for the other world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l001","ordinal":368698,"en":"They remained beside lion-hearted Seytek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l002","ordinal":368699,"en":"Serving as his comrades."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l003","ordinal":368700,"en":"Much of this is false and much is true;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l004","ordinal":368701,"en":"No one has returned from there after seeing it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l005","ordinal":368702,"en":"Half is invention and half is truth;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l006","ordinal":368703,"en":"Unless the Creator himself knows,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l007","ordinal":368704,"en":"No one has come back from beyond."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l008","ordinal":368705,"en":"How could we leave untold"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l009","ordinal":368706,"en":"The tale of your forefathers?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l010","ordinal":368707,"en":"The tale has turned into a sorrowful song;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l011","ordinal":368708,"en":"Let us speak again of the ordeal"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l012","ordinal":368709,"en":"Of that vanished warrior,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l013","ordinal":368710,"en":"Brave infidel Sarybai."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l014","ordinal":368711,"en":"His thrusting spear must have pierced,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l015","ordinal":368712,"en":"His reach extended across the world;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l016","ordinal":368713,"en":"He crushed every man who grappled with him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l017","ordinal":368714,"en":"His strength swelled and overflowed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l018","ordinal":368715,"en":"And in his fury he overran"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l019","ordinal":368716,"en":"The whole wide world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l020","ordinal":368717,"en":"Almambet’s son Külchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l021","ordinal":368718,"en":"In the battle of the day before,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l022","ordinal":368719,"en":"Had fought for seven days"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l023","ordinal":368720,"en":"And taken wounds in seven places;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l024","ordinal":368721,"en":"With scarcely a spark of life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l025","ordinal":368722,"en":"His lungs pounding painfully,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l026","ordinal":368723,"en":"He bore anguish too great for his breast"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l027","ordinal":368724,"en":"And wounds across much of his body."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l028","ordinal":368725,"en":"A spear had lodged in his side;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l029","ordinal":368726,"en":"When he seized and wrenched its head,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l030","ordinal":368727,"en":"A blue flame flared."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l031","ordinal":368728,"en":"He had raced upon Kulansur,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l032","ordinal":368729,"en":"And before fair Saikal"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l033","ordinal":368730,"en":"Had vied steed against steed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l034","ordinal":368731,"en":"The great army was caught in the flames,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l035","ordinal":368732,"en":"And spirit-favored Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l036","ordinal":368733,"en":"Barely escaped death."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l037","ordinal":368734,"en":"Because the mighty Kyrgyz host was there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l038","ordinal":368735,"en":"Drawing near in a darkened mass, he was saved."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l039","ordinal":368736,"en":"Before this, Sarybai’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b002:l040","ordinal":368737,"en":"Dread power had become clear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l001","ordinal":368738,"en":"And the people had despaired of life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l002","ordinal":368739,"en":"But then Manas appeared,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l003","ordinal":368740,"en":"Dazzling every heart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l004","ordinal":368741,"en":"Looking vast as blue Song-Köl,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l005","ordinal":368742,"en":"His majesty striking terror into souls,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l006","ordinal":368743,"en":"Making the Kula horse beneath him"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l007","ordinal":368744,"en":"Step proudly and high."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l008","ordinal":368745,"en":"He dazzled every heart:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l009","ordinal":368746,"en":"The lion whose patron spirit lived,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l010","ordinal":368747,"en":"The youngest of the six heroes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l011","ordinal":368748,"en":"A servant of almighty God."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l012","ordinal":368749,"en":"He dazzled every heart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l013","ordinal":368750,"en":"Appearing before their eyes as though alive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l014","ordinal":368751,"en":"The wandering saint Khydyr"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l015","ordinal":368752,"en":"Came straight forward to lend aid,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l016","ordinal":368753,"en":"Leading the proud-stepping Kula horse,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l017","ordinal":368754,"en":"With twelve noble warriors in his train."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l018","ordinal":368755,"en":"He dazzled every heart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l019","ordinal":368756,"en":"Appearing like a lofty blue mountain pass."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l020","ordinal":368757,"en":"Such was the man’s form."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l021","ordinal":368758,"en":"He seemed to fill the sky,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l022","ordinal":368759,"en":"Appearing as though alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l023","ordinal":368760,"en":"Like an alloy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l024","ordinal":368761,"en":"Of gold and silver,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l025","ordinal":368762,"en":"Like the moon and sun"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l026","ordinal":368763,"en":"United in a single being."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l027","ordinal":368764,"en":"Look closely upon this marvel:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l028","ordinal":368765,"en":"He seemed able to pass through the spindle-narrow cleft"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l029","ordinal":368766,"en":"Of a gaping gorge."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l030","ordinal":368767,"en":"His vast majesty rose like a glacier;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l031","ordinal":368768,"en":"Not merely Sarybai, but the whole world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l032","ordinal":368769,"en":"He seemed able to conquer if it opposed him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l033","ordinal":368770,"en":"The horse he rode was Akkula,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l034","ordinal":368771,"en":"Akkula, the racehorse swift as an arrow."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l035","ordinal":368772,"en":"Manas loomed enormous as a hill,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l036","ordinal":368773,"en":"Broad and towering as a blue mountain spur."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l037","ordinal":368774,"en":"The living spirit of your forefather"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l038","ordinal":368775,"en":"Stood grandly as his companion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l039","ordinal":368776,"en":"Taking his place at his right hand."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0952:b003:l040","ordinal":368777,"en":"His destiny was to wreak destruction—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l001","ordinal":368778,"en":"Such was the wonder they beheld."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l002","ordinal":368779,"en":"His forefather, mighty Manas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l003","ordinal":368780,"en":"Cried, “Stand firm beside my child!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l004","ordinal":368781,"en":"Shouting in a ringing voice,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l005","ordinal":368782,"en":"He reached out and laid hold,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l006","ordinal":368783,"en":"Supporting him beneath the arm."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l007","ordinal":368784,"en":"He set right what had been broken,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l008","ordinal":368785,"en":"Rejoined what had been severed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l009","ordinal":368786,"en":"And gathered what had been scattered."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l010","ordinal":368787,"en":"“May the ancestral spirits be my companions,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l011","ordinal":368788,"en":"Sarybai had once prayed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l012","ordinal":368789,"en":"But now, “Spirit of my true forefather,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l013","ordinal":368790,"en":"Drive back the bloodthirsty son!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l014","ordinal":368791,"en":"Drive all five claws of the spirit"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l015","ordinal":368792,"en":"Into the flank"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l016","ordinal":368793,"en":"Of that vaunting boar!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l017","ordinal":368794,"en":"Then a dazzling vision appeared:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l018","ordinal":368795,"en":"Gray-maned Manas, the leopard,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l019","ordinal":368796,"en":"Seemed like a battle standard"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l020","ordinal":368797,"en":"To young warrior Seytek."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l021","ordinal":368798,"en":"“Drive on, my son, drive on!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l022","ordinal":368799,"en":"Seize that slave before you!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l023","ordinal":368800,"en":"Terrify the life from him!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l024","ordinal":368801,"en":"Do not spare him from death—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l025","ordinal":368802,"en":"Steep your spear in blood!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l026","ordinal":368803,"en":"With Maral at their head, forty men"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l027","ordinal":368804,"en":"Shouted before him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l028","ordinal":368805,"en":"And when he looked, they had become tigers."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l029","ordinal":368806,"en":"A lion opened its jaws,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l030","ordinal":368807,"en":"And the spirit of my heroic father Manas"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l031","ordinal":368808,"en":"Grasped Seytek by the hem,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l032","ordinal":368809,"en":"Holding and supporting him without release."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l033","ordinal":368810,"en":"“Do not fear when battle comes!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l034","ordinal":368811,"en":"Thus brave Seytek"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l035","ordinal":368812,"en":"Launched a furious struggle with him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l036","ordinal":368813,"en":"May God never show us its like!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l037","ordinal":368814,"en":"Clashing their pinewood spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l038","ordinal":368815,"en":"Seytek and Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l039","ordinal":368816,"en":"Stood their ground and thrust at each other."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b002:l040","ordinal":368817,"en":"The earth broke and split,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l001","ordinal":368818,"en":"And all who saw it stood aghast;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l002","ordinal":368819,"en":"Their bosoms filled with clotted blood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l003","ordinal":368820,"en":"They struck ever harder,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l004","ordinal":368821,"en":"Thrusting face-to-face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l005","ordinal":368822,"en":"Pressing knee against knee,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l006","ordinal":368823,"en":"Seizing each other’s collars and tugging,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l007","ordinal":368824,"en":"And whenever the gray-maned champions found an opening,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l008","ordinal":368825,"en":"They struck with their fists."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l009","ordinal":368826,"en":"As the fierce conflict mounted,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l010","ordinal":368827,"en":"Those who drew close and saw them"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l011","ordinal":368828,"en":"Spared not their lives,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l012","ordinal":368829,"en":"But grappled collar-to-collar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l013","ordinal":368830,"en":"Their coats were torn to tatters,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l014","ordinal":368831,"en":"Their bodies were gashed all over,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l015","ordinal":368832,"en":"And at every place they struck,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l016","ordinal":368833,"en":"Their clenched hands filled with flesh."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l017","ordinal":368834,"en":"They butted like rams,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l018","ordinal":368835,"en":"Seizing each other’s collars and tugging."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l019","ordinal":368836,"en":"The savage struggle mounted,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l020","ordinal":368837,"en":"They planted their feet and wrestled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l021","ordinal":368838,"en":"And again the champions came to grips,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l022","ordinal":368839,"en":"Spitting at one another."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l023","ordinal":368840,"en":"Spears, swords, and battle-axes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l024","ordinal":368841,"en":"Were utterly shattered between them."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l025","ordinal":368842,"en":"If you would see a marvel, behold this:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l026","ordinal":368843,"en":"The immense battle thundered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l027","ordinal":368844,"en":"The wondrous tumult rose,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l028","ordinal":368845,"en":"As Sarybai and brave Seytek"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l029","ordinal":368846,"en":"Thrust at one another face-to-face."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l030","ordinal":368847,"en":"Behold the strength of those wrestlers!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l031","ordinal":368848,"en":"Tookyzyl and Kulansur"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l032","ordinal":368849,"en":"Were steeds surpassing all other beasts."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l033","ordinal":368850,"en":"In that vast and ruinous battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l034","ordinal":368851,"en":"As they met and thrust,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l035","ordinal":368852,"en":"Their coats split and fell in strips,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l036","ordinal":368853,"en":"Their fragile lives were hard-pressed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l037","ordinal":368854,"en":"And blood streamed and was swallowed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l038","ordinal":368855,"en":"Their precious, honored heads"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l039","ordinal":368856,"en":"Were sorely pressed by spears;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0953:b004:l040","ordinal":368857,"en":"It was a savage battle."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l001","ordinal":368858,"en":"Their eyes dimmed and wandered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l002","ordinal":368859,"en":"The heroic host that served them"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l003","ordinal":368860,"en":"Leaned back, unable to advance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l004","ordinal":368861,"en":"And began to retreat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l005","ordinal":368862,"en":"While the two fought without respite."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l006","ordinal":368863,"en":"Their noses were filled with steam,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l007","ordinal":368864,"en":"Their backs and waists ran with sweat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l008","ordinal":368865,"en":"Their loins bent rigid,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l009","ordinal":368866,"en":"And their dim eyes bulged."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l010","ordinal":368867,"en":"They drove each other onward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l011","ordinal":368868,"en":"And whenever they collided,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l012","ordinal":368869,"en":"They mauled each other like bull camels."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l013","ordinal":368870,"en":"Such was the nature of the strife."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l014","ordinal":368871,"en":"By day they never rested,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l015","ordinal":368872,"en":"By night they never slept,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l016","ordinal":368873,"en":"Never pausing even when they lay on their sides,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l017","ordinal":368874,"en":"Never lying down long enough to satisfy sleep;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l018","ordinal":368875,"en":"All rest was gone as they fought."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l019","ordinal":368876,"en":"Almighty God alone knew the great cause—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l020","ordinal":368877,"en":"Who had ever seen such a deed?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l021","ordinal":368878,"en":"The people cried out in grief,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l022","ordinal":368879,"en":"And as the two grappled, the black earth"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l023","ordinal":368880,"en":"Was torn from its hardened crust."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l024","ordinal":368881,"en":"Seytek and Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l025","ordinal":368882,"en":"Revealed the full measure of their valor."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l026","ordinal":368883,"en":"Their arrow-proof armor and coats"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l027","ordinal":368884,"en":"Were torn apart layer by layer."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l028","ordinal":368885,"en":"So fierce was the mighty battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l029","ordinal":368886,"en":"So terrible a sight to behold."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l030","ordinal":368887,"en":"Tookyzyl and Kulansur"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l031","ordinal":368888,"en":"Were drenched in crimson blood;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l032","ordinal":368889,"en":"Their entire bodies"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l033","ordinal":368890,"en":"Stood motionless and numb,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l034","ordinal":368891,"en":"While every arm and leg"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l035","ordinal":368892,"en":"Hung powerless, unable to move."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l036","ordinal":368893,"en":"Such was the contest now."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l037","ordinal":368894,"en":"As the struggle continued,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l038","ordinal":368895,"en":"Tookyzyl turned his head aside."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0954:b002:l039","ordinal":368896,"en":"He was a warrior formidable in cunning,"}]
